# The LR twin of ll.grm: its lists are left-recursive, and the same inputs
# build the same trees.
Start
| Entries

Entries@<
| Entries ";" Entry
| Entry

Entry
| Array
| "=" Sum

Array@!"]"^
| "[" Members

Members@<
| MembersHead "]"
| "]"

MembersHead@<
| MembersHead "," Item
| Item

Item
| Word
| Array

Sum@total
| Sum@< "+" Number
| Number

Word
| letter _Letters

_Letters
| letter _Letters
|

Number
| digit _Digits

_Digits
| digit _Digits
|
